      <VERS vnumber="36">The <gr str="3548">priests</gr>: the <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="3048">Jedaiah</gr>, of the <gr str="1004">house </gr>of <gr str="3442">Jeshua</gr>, <gr str="8672">nine </gr>
