      <VERS vnumber="41">The <gr str="7891">singers</gr>: the <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="623">Asaph</gr>, an <gr str="3967">hundred </gr>and <gr str="6242">twenty </gr>and <gr str="8083">eight</gr>.</VERS>
