      <VERS vnumber="54">The <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="5335">Neziah</gr>, the <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="2412">Hatipha</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="55">The <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="8010">Solomon’s </gr>
